"``max_dax_size_gb`` is used as the L1 Device-DAX overflow size."
msgstr "可选的 ``/dev/dax*`` 设备或可 mmap 的文件，用作 L1 后备区域。设置后，使用 ``--no-l1-use-lazy`` 禁用延迟分配，并将 ``--shm-name`` 保持为默认值 ``\"\"``（禁用 SHM 传输），因为 L1 字节位于 DAX 映射中。如果注册了具有相同 ``device_path`` 的 DAX L2 适配器，则该适配器的 ``max_dax_size_gb`` 用作 L1 Device-DAX 溢出大小。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:339
msgid "GDS L1 Tier"
msgstr "GDS L1 层"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:343
msgid ""
"Opt-in. Setting ``--gds-l1-path`` switches the L1 medium from pinned DRAM"
" to an NVMe slab file accessed via GPUDirect Storage DMA. The CPU pinned-"
"DRAM tier is then disabled, and ``--l1-size-gb`` sizes the slab. Disable "
"byte-array L2 adapters when this is on (the GDS tier exposes no L1 memory"
" buffer for them to register)."
msgstr ""
"选择加入。设置 ``--gds-l1-path`` 将 L1 媒介从固定 DRAM 切换到通过 GPUDirect Storage DMA 访问的"
" NVMe 块文件。然后禁用 CPU 固定 DRAM 层，并且 ``--l1-size-gb`` 设置块的大小。当此选项开启时，禁用字节数组 L2"
" 适配器（GDS 层不提供 L1 内存缓冲区供它们注册）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:349
msgid ""
"The DMA path is selected automatically by platform: **cuFile** "
"(``libcufile.so``) on NVIDIA and **hipFile** (``libhipfile.so``, "
"`ROCm/hipFile <https://github.com/ROCm/hipFile>`_) on AMD ROCm. The same "
"flags apply to both; no configuration change is needed to switch vendors."
msgstr ""
"DMA 路径由平台自动选择：NVIDIA 上使用 **cuFile** (``libcufile.so``)，而 AMD ROCm 上使用 "
"**hipFile** (``libhipfile.so``，`ROCm/hipFile "
"<https://github.com/ROCm/hipFile>`_)。这两个平台适用相同的标志；切换供应商无需更改配置。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:354
msgid ""
"**uGDS** (``libugds.so``) is a third, opt-in backend selected with "
"``--gds-l1-backend ugds``. It is a user-space GPUDirect Storage library "
"that builds NVMe commands and rings doorbells from user space, so its IO "
"path issues no syscall. LMCache can use uGDS on either NVIDIA CUDA or AMD"
" ROCm. Each deployment must use a ``libugds.so`` built for its active "
"platform. Unlike cuFile and hipFile, uGDS does not use a filesystem: the "
"slab is mapped directly onto a raw character device, and "
"``--gds-l1-path`` must name that device (for example ``/dev/ugds_drv0``) "
"rather than a directory. The first ``--l1-size-gb`` bytes of the device "
"are the slab, so the device must be at least that large and must not hold"
" anything else."
msgstr "**uGDS** (``libugds.so``) 是第三个可选的后端，通过 ``--gds-l1-backend ugds`` 进行选择。它是一个用户空间的 GPUDirect Storage 库，可以从用户空间构建 NVMe 命令并触发门铃，因此其 IO 路径不会发出系统调用。LMCache 可以在 NVIDIA CUDA 或 AMD ROCm 上使用 uGDS。每个部署必须使用为其活动平台构建的 ``libugds.so``。与 cuFile 和 hipFile 不同，uGDS 不使用文件系统：该块直接映射到原始字符设备上，``--gds-l1-path`` 必须指定该设备（例如 ``/dev/ugds_drv0``），而不是目录。设备的前 ``--l1-size-gb`` 字节是该块，因此设备必须至少大于或等于该大小，并且不能存储其他内容。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:365
msgid ""
"**Phoenix** (``libphoenix.so``) is a fourth opt-in backend selected with "
"``--gds-l1-backend phx``. Phoenix (phxfs) provides a kernel-mediated "
"user-space NVMe-to-GPU DMA path with a very low software-stack overhead. "
"Like cuFile and hipFile it uses a filesystem slab: ``--gds-l1-path`` "
"names an NVMe directory, ``--gds-l1-use-direct-io`` applies, and the slab"
" file can share the disk with other data. Each GPU staging buffer is "
"registered with phxfs (``phxfs_regmem``, 64 KiB-aligned) and the slab is "
"read and written with stream-ordered submissions (``phxfs_read_stream`` /"
" ``phxfs_write_stream``) that keep the DMA ordered with the other work on"
" the stream. A ``libphoenix`` build without the stream-ordered API fails "
"to load. Follow the `Phoenix installation guide <https://github.com/xPU-"
"IO/Phoenix/blob/main/doc/install.md>`_ to build ``libphoenix.so``, load "
"the ``phoenixfs`` kernel module, and verify the installation."
msgstr "**Phoenix** (``libphoenix.so``) 是第四个可选后端，通过 ``--gds-l1-backend phx`` 进行选择。Phoenix (phxfs) 提供了一条内核介导的用户空间 NVMe 到 GPU 的 DMA 路径，具有非常低的软件栈开销。与 cuFile 和 hipFile 一样，它使用文件系统 slab：``--gds-l1-path`` 指定一个 NVMe 目录，``--gds-l1-use-direct-io`` 适用，并且 slab 文件可以与其他数据共享磁盘。每个 GPU 暂存缓冲区都在 phxfs 中注册（``phxfs_regmem``，64 KiB 对齐），并且 slab 通过流顺序提交进行读写（``phxfs_read_stream`` / ``phxfs_write_stream``），以保持 DMA 与流上的其他工作有序。没有流顺序 API 的 ``libphoenix`` 构建将无法加载。请遵循 `Phoenix 安装指南 <https://github.com/xPU-IO/Phoenix/blob/main/doc/install.md>`_ 来构建 ``libphoenix.so``，加载 ``phoenixfs`` 内核模块，并验证安装。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:384
msgid ""
"AMD hipFile requires ROCm >= 7.2.0. The zero-copy GPUDirect fast path "
"additionally needs a kernel built with ``CONFIG_PCI_P2PDMA``, ``amdgpu-"
"dkms >= 30.20.1``, and the slab on a local NVMe ext4/xfs filesystem; "
"where those are unavailable hipFile transparently falls back to a host-"
"bounce compatibility path (correct, but not zero-copy)."
msgstr ""
"AMD hipFile 需要 ROCm >= 7.2.0。零拷贝 GPUDirect 快速路径还需要一个使用 "
"``CONFIG_PCI_P2PDMA`` 构建的内核、``amdgpu-dkms >= 30.20.1``，以及在本地 NVMe "
"ext4/xfs 文件系统上的 slab；如果这些不可用，hipFile 会透明地回退到主机跳跃兼容路径（正确，但不是零拷贝）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:392
msgid ""
"uGDS requires its kernel module loaded and the NVMe device bound to it, "
"and a platform-matching ``libugds.so`` reachable through the loader "
"(``LD_LIBRARY_PATH`` or ``ldconfig``). Because the device is claimed by "
"``ugds_drv`` rather than the kernel NVMe driver, it carries no filesystem"
" and cannot be shared with any other consumer while in use. Follow the "
"`uGDS installation guide <https://github.com/ScaleX-"
"IO/uGDS/blob/main/docs/installation.md>`_ to build and load the kernel "
"module, bind the NVMe device, build ``libugds.so``, and verify the "
"installation."
msgstr "uGDS 需要加载其内核模块，并将 NVMe 设备绑定到该模块，以及通过加载器（``LD_LIBRARY_PATH`` 或 ``ldconfig``）可访问与平台匹配的 ``libugds.so``。由于设备由 ``ugds_drv`` 而不是内核 NVMe 驱动程序声明，因此它不携带文件系统，并且在使用时无法与其他消费者共享。请遵循 `uGDS 安装指南 <https://github.com/ScaleX-IO/uGDS/blob/main/docs/installation.md>`_ 来构建和加载内核模块，绑定 NVMe 设备，构建 ``libugds.so``，并验证安装。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:401
msgid ""
"At startup LMCache queries the namespace capacity through "
"``uGDSGetDeviceCapacity`` and rejects an aligned ``--l1-size-gb`` value "
"larger than the device. The installed ``libugds.so`` must provide this "
"API; LMCache fails closed with an upgrade message when an older library "
"cannot report capacity."
msgstr "在启动时，LMCache 通过 ``uGDSGetDeviceCapacity`` 查询命名空间容量，并拒绝大于设备的对齐 ``--l1-size-gb`` 值。安装的 ``libugds.so`` 必须提供此 API；当旧版库无法报告容量时，LMCache 会以升级消息关闭。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:408
msgid ""
"uGDS requires an **entire dedicated SSD whose contents may be "
"destroyed**. Ensure the SSD is not used for any other purpose and that "
"its contents are not critical."
msgstr "uGDS 需要一个 **完全专用的 SSD，其内容可能会被销毁**。确保该 SSD 不用于任何其他目的，并且其内容并不重要。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:414
msgid ""
"Phoenix requires the ``phoenixfs`` kernel module loaded and a platform-"
"matching ``libphoenix.so`` reachable through the loader (``ldconfig`` or "
"``LD_LIBRARY_PATH``). It has been validated on NVIDIA GPUs; other "
"platforms require a matching ``libphoenix`` build and are not yet tested."
msgstr "Phoenix 需要加载 ``phoenixfs`` 内核模块，并且通过加载器（``ldconfig`` 或 ``LD_LIBRARY_PATH``）能够访问与平台匹配的 ``libphoenix.so``。它已在 NVIDIA GPU 上验证；其他平台需要匹配的 ``libphoenix`` 构建，并且尚未经过测试。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:427
