"All connector-level options are passed through "
"``kv_connector_extra_config`` and use the ``lmcache.mp.`` prefix."
msgstr "所有连接器级别的选项都通过 ``kv_connector_extra_config`` 传递，并使用 ``lmcache.mp.`` 前缀。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:740
msgid "Key"
msgstr "键"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:743
msgid "``lmcache.mp.server_urls``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.server_urls``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:744
msgid "*(unset)*"
msgstr "*(未设置)*"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:745
msgid ""
"Multi-server deployment: list (or comma-separated string) of "
"``<transport>://<host>:<port>`` URLs, e.g. "
"``\"tcp://host1:6667,tcp://host2:6667\"``. The transport prefix may be "
"omitted -- bare ``host:port`` entries such as "
"``\"host1:6667,host2:6667\"`` are normalized to ``tcp://`` by the "
"connector. When set, takes precedence over ``lmcache.mp.host`` / "
"``lmcache.mp.port``; the vLLM world size must be divisible by the number "
"of servers, and each worker connects to its locally-assigned server."
msgstr "多服务器部署：``<transport>://<host>:<port>`` URL 的列表（或以逗号分隔的字符串），例如 ``\"tcp://host1:6667,tcp://host2:6667\"``。传输前缀可以省略——裸 ``host:port`` 条目如 ``\"host1:6667,host2:6667\"`` 会被连接器规范化为 ``tcp://``。设置后，优先于 ``lmcache.mp.host`` / ``lmcache.mp.port``；vLLM 的世界大小必须能够被服务器数量整除，每个工作者连接到其本地分配的服务器。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:754
msgid "``lmcache.mp.host``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.host``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:755
msgid "``tcp://localhost``"
msgstr "``tcp://localhost``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:756
msgid ""
"Single-server deployment: request transport and host of the LMCache MP "
"server. Use ``tcp://`` for ZMQ or ``grpc://`` for gRPC. A bare "
"``localhost`` / ``127.0.0.1`` is normalized to ``tcp://`` by the "
"connector. Ignored when ``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` is set."
msgstr "单服务器部署：LMCache MP 服务器的请求传输和主机。对于 ZMQ 使用 ``tcp://``，对于 gRPC 使用 ``grpc://``。裸露的 ``localhost`` / ``127.0.0.1`` 会被连接器规范化为 ``tcp://``。当 ``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` 被设置时将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:760
msgid "``lmcache.mp.port``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.port``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:762
msgid ""
"Single-server deployment: port of the LMCache MP server. Must match the "
"server's ``--port``. Ignored when ``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` is set."
msgstr ""
"单服务器部署：LMCache MP 服务器的端口。必须与服务器的 ``--port`` 匹配。当设置了 "
"``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` 时将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:765
msgid "``lmcache.mp.mq_timeout``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.mq_timeout``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:766
msgid "``300.0``"
msgstr "``300.0``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:767
msgid ""
"Timeout (seconds) for blocking message-queue requests, including the "
"initial chunk-size query and KV cache registration/unregistration. If the"
" server does not respond within this window, the connector raises "
"``ConnectionError`` on startup."
msgstr ""
"阻塞消息队列请求的超时时间（秒），包括初始块大小查询和 KV Cache 注册/注销。如果服务器在此时间窗口内未响应，连接器将在启动时引发 "
"``ConnectionError``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:771
msgid "``lmcache.mp.heartbeat_interval``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.heartbeat_interval``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:773
msgid ""
"Interval (seconds) between periodic heartbeat pings sent from the "
"connector to the server."
msgstr "连接器向服务器发送周期性心跳 PING 的时间间隔（秒）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:775
msgid "``lmcache.mp.nonblocking_lookup_status``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.nonblocking_lookup_status``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:776
msgid "``true``"
msgstr "``true``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:777
msgid ""
"Poll lookup-status replies without blocking the scheduler by default. Set"
" to ``false`` to wait for each status RPC reply in the current callback, "
"for example when long prefill steps delay observation of an already-ready"
" reply. LOOKUP acknowledgement polling remains asynchronous. Available "
"with the current ``LMCacheMPConnector``."
msgstr "默认情况下，轮询查找状态回复而不阻塞调度程序。设置为 ``false`` 以在当前回调中等待每个状态 RPC 回复，例如，当长时间的 Prefill 步骤延迟了对已准备好回复的观察时。LOOKUP 确认轮询仍然是异步的。当前 ``LMCacheMPConnector`` 可用。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:782
msgid "``lmcache.mp.eager_prefetch``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.eager_prefetch``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:784
msgid ""
"Submit the LMCache lookup when a request enters vLLM's waiting queue, "
"allowing L2-to-L1 KV staging to overlap with scheduler queue wait. "
"Resumable requests are skipped because their token IDs may be incomplete "
"at enqueue time."
msgstr "当请求进入 vLLM 的等待队列时提交 LMCache 查找，允许 L2 到 L1 的 KV 阶段与调度器队列等待重叠。可恢复的请求会被跳过，因为它们的令牌 ID 在入队时可能不完整。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:788
msgid "``lmcache.mp.autostart``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.autostart``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:790
msgid ""
"Whether vLLM worker 0 should start a local ``lmcache server`` process "
"before workers connect to it. Other local workers wait for the server to "
"become reachable. Only ``localhost`` and ``127.0.0.1`` are supported. "
"IPv6 endpoints, including ``::1``, raise ``ValueError`` before startup "
"because the MP ZMQ transport does not enable IPv6 sockets. Auto-start "
"supports exactly one server endpoint; configuring multiple "
"``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` raises ``ValueError`` during connector "
"initialization."
msgstr "是否应该在工作进程连接到它之前，启动本地 ``lmcache server`` 进程。其他本地工作进程会等待服务器变得可访问。仅支持 ``localhost`` 和 ``127.0.0.1``。IPv6 端点，包括 ``::1``，在启动前会引发 ``ValueError``，因为 MP ZMQ 传输不支持 IPv6 套接字。自动启动仅支持一个服务器端点；配置多个 ``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` 在连接器初始化时会引发 ``ValueError``。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:798
msgid "``lmcache.mp.autostart.wait_timeout``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.autostart.wait_timeout``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:799
msgid "``90.0``"
msgstr "``90.0``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:800
msgid ""
"Timeout (seconds) to wait for the auto-started server to respond to ZMQ "
"``PING`` requests. Must be positive and finite."
msgstr "等待自动启动的服务器响应 ZMQ ``PING`` 请求的超时时间（秒）。必须为正数且有限。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:802
msgid "``lmcache.mp.autostart.server_args``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.autostart.server_args``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:804
msgid ""
"Extra command-line arguments passed to the auto-started MP HTTP server "
"process. Required server settings such as ``--l1-size-gb`` and "
"``--eviction-policy`` must be supplied here. For example, pass ``--l1"
"-size-gb 20 --eviction-policy LRU``. Endpoint flags such as ``--host``, "
"``--port``, and ``--http-host`` are rejected because the auto-started ZMQ"
" and HTTP listeners are bound to the local connector endpoint. If "
"multiple auto-started MP servers run on the same host, pass distinct "
"``--http-port`` values here to avoid HTTP frontend port conflicts."
msgstr "传递给自动启动的 MP HTTP 服务器进程的额外命令行参数。必须在此处提供所需的服务器设置，例如 ``--l1-size-gb`` 和 ``--eviction-policy``。例如，传递 ``--l1-size-gb 20 --eviction-policy LRU``。诸如 ``--host``、``--port`` 和 ``--http-host`` 的端点标志将被拒绝，因为自动启动的 ZMQ 和 HTTP 监听器绑定到本地连接器端点。如果在同一主机上运行多个自动启动的 MP 服务器，请在此处传递不同的 ``--http-port`` 值，以避免 HTTP 前端端口冲突。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:813
msgid "``lmcache.mp.mp_transfer_mode``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.mp_transfer_mode``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:815
msgid ""
"Routing mode for the worker -> server transfer context. One of ``auto`` "
"(CUDA -> lmcache_driven, others -> engine_driven), ``lmcache_driven`` "
"(force the IPC / SHM zero-copy handle path — LMCache server pulls data "
"via device handles), or ``engine_driven`` (force the worker-side "
"gather/scatter copy path). Overrides the ``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE`` env"
" var when set."
msgstr ""
"工作进程与服务器传输上下文的路由模式。可以是 ``auto``（CUDA -> lmcache_driven，其他 -> "
"engine_driven）、``lmcache_driven``（强制使用 IPC / SHM 零拷贝句柄路径 — LMCache "
"服务器通过设备句柄拉取数据）或 ``engine_driven``（强制使用工作进程端的收集/分散拷贝路径）。当设置时，会覆盖 "
"``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE`` 环境变量。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:822
msgid "``lmcache.mp.isolated_ipc``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.isolated_ipc``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:824
msgid ""
"Assume the vLLM workers and the LMCache server run in containers that "
"share no host IPC namespace (``hostIPC``) and no common ``/dev/shm``, and"
" use IPC mechanisms that work there: on CUDA, raw CUDA IPC memory handles"
" for KV-cache registration and timeline-semaphore events instead of CUDA "
"interprocess *event* handles. Set it together with the server's "
"``--isolated-ipc`` flag -- a mismatch fails at event import on whichever "
"side receives the foreign handle."
msgstr "假设 vLLM 工作进程和 LMCache 服务器在不共享主机 IPC 命名空间（``hostIPC``）和公共 ``/dev/shm`` 的容器中运行，并使用在此处有效的 IPC 机制：在 CUDA 上，使用原始 CUDA IPC 内存句柄进行 KV Cache 注册和时间线信号量事件，而不是 CUDA 进程间 *事件* 句柄。将其与服务器的 ``--isolated-ipc`` 标志一起设置——不匹配会导致在接收外部句柄的一方事件导入失败。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:832
msgid "``lmcache.mp.use_vmm_api``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.use_vmm_api``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:834
msgid ""
"Set when the engine allocates its KV cache through the CUDA VMM API "
"(vLLM's ``--enable-cumem-allocator``): such memory has no legacy CUDA IPC"
" handle, so KV-cache registration exports it via "
"``cuMemExportToShareableHandle`` instead (a fabric handle when the "
"allocation is fabric-exportable -- requires an IMEX channel device, e.g. "
"``NVIDIA_IMEX_CHANNELS=0`` -- or a POSIX fd otherwise). Composes with "
"``lmcache.mp.isolated_ipc`` for fabric-exportable pools; a POSIX-fd-only "
"pool under isolated IPC is rejected at registration."
msgstr "当引擎通过 CUDA VMM API（vLLM 的 ``--enable-cumem-allocator``）分配其 KV Cache 时设置：此类内存没有传统的 CUDA IPC 句柄，因此 KV Cache 注册通过 ``cuMemExportToShareableHandle`` 导出（当分配是可导出到 fabric 时为 fabric 句柄——需要 IMEX 通道设备，例如 ``NVIDIA_IMEX_CHANNELS=0``——否则为 POSIX fd）。与 ``lmcache.mp.isolated_ipc`` 组合用于可导出到 fabric 的池；在隔离 IPC 下，仅 POSIX fd 的池在注册时被拒绝。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:843
msgid "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:845
msgid ""
"Buffer stores on the scheduler and submit them according to the selected "
"lazy-offload policy. Requires vLLM prefix caching. See "
":doc:`lazy_offload` for behavior, limitations, and tuning guidance."
msgstr "缓冲区存储在调度器上，并根据所选的延迟卸载策略提交它们。需要 vLLM 前缀缓存。有关行为、限制和调优指导，请参见 :doc:`lazy_offload`。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:848
msgid "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_policy``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_policy``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:849
msgid "``EVICTION_AWARE``"
msgstr "``EVICTION_AWARE``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:850
msgid ""
"Lazy drain policy. ``EVICTION_AWARE`` drains blocks near the GPU free "
"queue's eviction head. Set ``FIFO`` explicitly to keep the count-"
"triggered behavior."
msgstr "惰性排水策略。``EVICTION_AWARE`` 在 GPU 空闲队列的逐出头附近排出块。显式设置 ``FIFO`` 以保持计数触发的行为。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:853
msgid "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_horizon_steps``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_horizon_steps``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:854
msgid "``2.5``"
msgstr "``2.5``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:855
msgid ""
"``EVICTION_AWARE`` only: estimated scheduler steps of block consumption "
"treated as imminent eviction. Must be greater than zero. Larger values "
"store earlier and reduce eviction losses, but may store GPU-resident hot "
"content and increase lower-tier eviction pressure."
msgstr "``EVICTION_AWARE`` 仅适用：块消耗的估计调度器步骤被视为即将发生的逐出。必须大于零。较大的值会更早存储并减少逐出损失，但可能会存储显存中的热内容并增加低层逐出压力。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:859
msgid "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_max_drain_per_step``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_max_drain_per_step``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:860
msgid "``64``"
msgstr "``64``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:861
msgid ""
"``EVICTION_AWARE`` only: maximum store operations emitted per scheduler "
"step. A value below the concurrent prefill admission rate can lose "
"buffered operations to eviction."
msgstr "仅适用于 ``EVICTION_AWARE``：每个调度器步骤发出的最大存储操作。低于并发预取接纳速率的值可能会导致缓冲操作被逐出。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:864
msgid "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_max_deferral_seconds``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_max_deferral_seconds``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:865
msgid "``0.0``"
msgstr "``0.0``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:866
msgid ""
"``EVICTION_AWARE`` only: how long a buffered operation may wait before it"
" is emitted regardless of eviction pressure. Not a hard bound: no drain "
"runs on a step that schedules no tokens, a request whose store is already"
" in flight is skipped, and due operations that do not fit in "
"``max_drain_per_step`` wait for a later step. Zero leaves emission "
"entirely to the danger window. Set it below the reuse interval the "
"workload has to beat."
msgstr "``EVICTION_AWARE`` 仅适用：缓冲操作在被发出之前可以等待的时间，无论逐出压力如何。这不是一个硬性限制：在没有调度任何令牌的步骤上不会进行排水运行，已经在进行中的请求会被跳过，而不符合 ``max_drain_per_step`` 的待处理操作会等待下一个步骤。零值完全将发出留给危险窗口。将其设置为低于工作负载必须超越的重用间隔。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:873
msgid "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_threshold``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_threshold``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:875
msgid "``FIFO`` only: number of finished buffered requests that triggers a drain."
msgstr "仅适用于 ``FIFO``：触发排空的已完成缓冲请求数量。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:877
msgid "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_select_count``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.lazy_offload_select_count``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:878
msgid "``10``"
msgstr "``10``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:879
msgid "``FIFO`` only: maximum finished requests emitted by one drain."
msgstr "仅 ``FIFO``：由一个排水口发出的最大完成请求数量。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:881
msgid "To let vLLM worker 0 start a local MP server automatically:"
msgstr "要让 vLLM worker 0 自动启动本地 MP 服务器："

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:889
msgid ""
"Auto-start is a convenience for single-node, single-server deployments. "
"The MP server is a child of vLLM worker 0, not an independently managed "
"service."
msgstr "自动启动是单节点、单服务器部署的便利。MP 服务器是 vLLM 工作节点 0 的子进程，而不是独立管理的服务。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:894
msgid ""
"LMCache's adapter shutdown does not explicitly terminate this child, but "
"vLLM's process-tree cleanup may terminate it. Its lifetime depends on the"
" vLLM version and exit path; neither survival nor automatic cleanup is "
"guaranteed. Stop any remaining auto-started server when it is no longer "
"needed."
msgstr "LMCache 的适配器关闭并不会明确终止这个子进程，但 vLLM 的进程树清理可能会终止它。它的生命周期取决于 vLLM 版本和退出路径；既不保证存活，也不保证自动清理。当不再需要时，请停止任何剩余的自动启动服务器。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:900
msgid ""
"For servers that must survive vLLM restarts or be shared across vLLM "
"instances, and for multi-node TP/PP deployments, start and manage the "
"server separately. For example, run the server in a separate terminal or "
"service manager and leave auto-start disabled in vLLM:"
msgstr "对于必须在 vLLM 重启后存活或在 vLLM 实例之间共享的服务器，以及多节点 TP/PP 部署，请单独启动和管理服务器。例如，在单独的终端或服务管理器中运行服务器，并在 vLLM 中禁用自动启动："

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:926
msgid "Environment Variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:932
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:934
msgid "``LMCACHE_LOG_LEVEL``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_LOG_LEVEL``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:935
msgid ""
"Log level for LMCache (``DEBUG``, ``INFO``, ``WARNING``, ``ERROR``). Set "
"to ``DEBUG`` to see L2 store activity, prefetch results, etc."
msgstr ""
"LMCache 的日志级别（\\ ``DEBUG``\\ 、\\ ``INFO``\\ 、\\ ``WARNING``\\ 、\\ "
"``ERROR``\\ ）。设置为 ``DEBUG`` 以查看 L2 存储活动、预取结果等。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:937
msgid "``PYTHONHASHSEED``"
msgstr "``PYTHONHASHSEED``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:938
msgid ""
"Set to a fixed value for reproducible hashing across processes (relevant "
"when using ``--hash-algorithm builtin``)."
msgstr "设置为固定值以实现跨进程的可重复哈希（在使用 ``--hash-algorithm builtin`` 时相关）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:940
msgid "``LMCACHE_TRACK_USAGE``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_TRACK_USAGE``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:941
msgid "Set to ``false`` to disable anonymous usage statistics (see below)."
msgstr "设置为 ``false`` 以禁用匿名使用统计（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:942
msgid "``DO_NOT_TRACK``"
msgstr "``DO_NOT_TRACK``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:943
msgid ""
"Set to ``1`` to disable anonymous usage statistics (cross-tool "
"convention)."
msgstr "设置为 ``1`` 以禁用匿名使用统计信息（跨工具约定）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:945
msgid "``LMCACHE_USAGE_TRACK_INTERVAL``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_USAGE_TRACK_INTERVAL``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:946
msgid ""
"Seconds between continuous usage-telemetry flushes (default ``600``). See"
" :ref:`usage-stats-collection`."
msgstr "连续使用遥测刷新之间的秒数（默认 ``600``）。请参见 :ref:`usage-stats-collection`。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:950
msgid "Full Example"
msgstr "完整示例"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:986
msgid "Anonymous Usage Statistics"
msgstr "匿名使用统计"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:988
msgid ""
"The MP server reports anonymous usage statistics: a one-time "
"environment/configuration snapshot at startup and interval counters "
"(tokens retrieved/stored, bytes stored, uptime) every "
"``LMCACHE_USAGE_TRACK_INTERVAL`` seconds. No prompts, keys, KV-cache "
"data, model names, or ``--instance-id`` are ever sent, and reporting can "
"never affect serving. Opt out with ``LMCACHE_TRACK_USAGE=false`` or "
"``DO_NOT_TRACK=1``; see :ref:`usage-stats-collection` for details."
msgstr ""
"MP 服务器报告匿名使用统计信息：在启动时进行一次环境/配置快照，并每 ``LMCACHE_USAGE_TRACK_INTERVAL`` "
"秒报告一次间隔计数器（检索/存储的令牌、存储的字节、正常运行时间）。绝不会发送提示、密钥、KV Cache 数据、模型名称或 "
"``--instance-id``，并且报告绝不会影响服务。可以通过 ``LMCACHE_TRACK_USAGE=false`` 或 "
"``DO_NOT_TRACK=1`` 选择退出；有关详细信息，请参见 :ref:`usage-stats-collection`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Enable or disable lazy allocation for"
#~ " L1 memory. Pass ``--l1-use-lazy`` to"
#~ " enable (default) or ``--no-l1-use-lazy``"
#~ " to explicitly disable."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "启用或禁用 L1 内存的延迟分配。传递 ``--l1-use-lazy`` "
#~ "以启用（默认）或 ``--no-l1-use-lazy`` 以显式禁用。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Cache engine backend type. ``default`` "
#~ "uses MPCacheEngine; ``blend`` uses "
#~ "BlendEngineV2 for cross-request KV "
#~ "reuse. Choices: ``default``, ``blend``."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "缓存引擎后端类型。``default`` 使用 MPCacheEngine；``blend`` 使用"
#~ " BlendEngineV2 进行跨请求的 KV "
#~ "重用。可选项：``default``，``blend``。"

